{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2026-01", "window": 3, "start_date": 1768521600, "end_date": 1769212799, "month_true_total": 151, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 18:07:55 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "216644542", "author": {"steamid": "76561198061970445", "personaname": "Engine&Tonic", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/engineandtonic/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 70, "playtime_forever": 562, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 562, "last_played": 1769169365, "avatar": "825d178f1ab894c735befc4e560dc428023af1a3"}, "language": "english", "review": "Pretty well-done, but not enough variety of combat and enemies. Play Boltgun instead.", "timestamp_created": 1769209886, "timestamp_updated": 1769209886, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "216620500", "author": {"steamid": "76561199769792899", "personaname": "Testicle Flicker", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/The_Camo_Campain_Dude_6925/", "num_games_owned": 96, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 581, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 185, "last_played": 1772860637, "avatar": "4d08da4b4551646011cfca7df976fe517eaa1281"}, "language": "english", "review": "yeah its good", "timestamp_created": 1769187022, "timestamp_updated": 1769187022, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "hardware": {"system_ram": "32471", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-14650HX", "adapter_description": "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 Laptop GPU", "vram_size": 7956}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "216612483", "author": {"steamid": "76561198257836668", "personaname": "The Loaf", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/BnckBread/", "num_games_owned": 55, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 840, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 840, "last_played": 1715785802, "avatar": "a38430eab418ff0b5f1653b6d06222b279ca3afc"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's a decent game, you do feel the strength of being a spacemarine, BUT the game just feels bad otherwise.\n\nCampaign is short, the story is ok (that's just my opinion), and the multiplayer is underwhelming. Even if it was really popular, the PvP feels just very limited. You die so quickly, and weapons that kill quickly have big downsides or require you to play like nnever before. And the movement is limited, making it even more difficult..\nAlso, 50 dollars CAD does still feel expensive for this game, despite how small it feels.", "timestamp_created": 1769179381, "timestamp_updated": 1769179381, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "216591398", "author": {"steamid": "76561199508354938", "personaname": "ironjerm", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199508354938/", "num_games_owned": 92, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 478, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 201, "last_played": 1769326662, "avatar": "63975cdd89a26a9cbbb29d918c7b46fad806a256"}, "language": "english", "review": "Pretty fun game. One huge flaw it has is that the game can crash in different sections. On the 6th chapter I had a part where I just couldn’t get past a cutscene without crashing and it made my fans go crazy too. You need to play this by searching up a github fix, SpaceMarineCoreFix, put the file into the game folder, and it’ll likely fix everything. That aside, gameplay is great, story is interesting but doesn’t get in the way of the fun, and it’s just a decent game to play while chatting with friends or to wind down without needing to fully lock in, like you do with sweaty multiplayer or crazy story heavy games. Definitely worth the $10", "timestamp_created": 1769148557, "timestamp_updated": 1769148637, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 11, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.658816695213317871", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "216583721", "author": {"steamid": "76561199575514219", "personaname": "Caelum", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199575514219/", "num_games_owned": 24, "num_reviews": 33, "playtime_forever": 591, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 591, "last_played": 1769135857, "avatar": "7ffad88ba9177c860a54d019201ba031747399b8"}, "language": "english", "review": "For the Ultramar", "timestamp_created": 1769136095, "timestamp_updated": 1769136095, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}]}